  test_mode_err_lib.pcpp - break step of test_mode.pcpp:
  @unitTestMode in a lib: no program runs its tests (SM0110)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\test_mode_err_lib.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\test_mode_err_lib.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module lib test_mode_err_lib;

@unitTestMode on; // ERROR SM0110@1: @unitTestMode in a dll or lib module

end.
